  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the crushed juniper berries and cook for 1 minute",
    "Add the red lentils, vegetable broth, and salt, and bring to a boil",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 30 minutes",
    "Smoke the stew with binchotan charcoal for 10 minutes",
    "Stir in the yogurt and serve hot"
